# Shared assemblage page

This page contains the platform-independent part of the example. The runnable
page [[transclusion_cli]] transcludes these sections and supplies its own
Target.

## Schema

```
Game = Int/value
```

## Construction

```
[:Game 21]
```

## Methods

```
Game::double = { value + value }
```

## Target

```
%cli-live

%init
var assemblage;

function init() {
    assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory();
}

%step
function step(line) {
    wchntConsole.println(assemblage.double());
}
```
